OL,3,GNEWSAWork to begin on improving city
OL,4,Acentre phone signal
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to boost the mobile phone signal
OL,7,Fin Chichester city centre is set to
OL,8,Fbegin after complaints from visitors.
OL,10,FWest Sussex County Council said it
OL,11,Fwould install infrastructure aimed at
OL,12,Fimproving the signal after residents
OL,13,Fand businesses also complained that
OL,14,Funreliable coverage was affecting them.
OL,16,FThe first phase of works is due to
OL,17,Fbegin on Monday with columns being
OL,18,Fplaced away from high footfall areas to
OL,19,Ftry to blend into the surroundings, the
OL,20,Fcouncil said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
