OL,3,GNEWSAWork to begin on improving city
OL,4,Acentre phone signal
OL,5,
OL,6,FChichester District Council leader
OL,7,FAdrian Moss said: "This investment will
OL,8,Fhelp businesses across Chichester
OL,9,Fbenefit from better connectivity,
OL,10,Fmaking it easier to adopt new
OL,11,Ftechnologies and take cashless
OL,12,Fpayments."
